@startuml 07-send-message-blocking
title POST /api/chat/sessions/{id}/messages — JSON blocking (Accept: application/json)

actor Client as C
participant "ChatController" as Ctrl
participant "SendMessageUseCase\n(ChatService)" as CS
participant "ChatRepository" as CR
participant "AnswerQuestionUseCase\n(RagService)" as RS
participant "EmbeddingProvider\n(OpenAI)" as EP
participant "SearchChunksUseCase\n(VectorService)" as VS
participant "ChunkStore (PgVector)" as STORE
participant "PromptBuilder" as PB
participant "LlmClient (Anthropic)" as LLM
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

C -> Ctrl: POST /messages\nAccept: application/json\nbody: { content: "Ile kosztuje..." }
activate Ctrl

Ctrl -> CS: send(SendMessageCommand)
activate CS

CS -> CR: findSessionById(id)
CR -> DB: SELECT chat_sessions WHERE id=?
CR --> CS: ChatSession (lub 404)

CS -> CR: saveMessage(userMessage)\n(role=USER)
CR -> DB: INSERT messages

note over CS #LightBlue: Wczytaj historię:\nostatnich N=10 wiadomości\n(memoryWindowSize w config)\n→ kontekst dla follow-up pytań

CS -> CR: findRecentMessages(sessionId, 10)
CR -> DB: SELECT * FROM messages\nWHERE session_id=?\nORDER BY created_at DESC LIMIT 10
CR --> CS: List<Message>

CS -> RS: answer(RagQuery)\n(question + history + RagOptions)
activate RS

RS -> EP: embed(question)
EP -> EP: POST openai/embeddings
EP --> RS: float[1536]

RS -> VS: search(VectorSearchQuery)\n(topK=5, minScore=0.3)
activate VS
VS -> STORE: search(tenantId, embedding, candidateLimit=50)
STORE -> DB: SELECT chunks, 1 - (embedding <=> ?) AS similarity\nFROM chunks WHERE tenant_id=?\nORDER BY embedding <=> ?\nLIMIT 50
STORE --> VS: List<VectorSearchResult>
note over VS #LightBlue: Filter similarity >= 0.3\nlimit topK=5
VS --> RS: top 5 chunks
deactivate VS

RS -> PB: build(chunks, history, question)
note over PB #LightBlue: System prompt PL:\n"Odpowiadaj WYŁĄCZNIE\nna podstawie kontekstu...\nJeśli brak — powiedz że nie wiesz."\n+ chunks jako [1] [2] [3]...\n+ historia rozmowy\n+ aktualne pytanie

RS -> LLM: complete(prompt, temp=0.2, max=1024)
LLM -> LLM: POST api.anthropic.com\nmodel: claude-haiku-4-5
LLM --> RS: LlmResponse(text, tokensUsed)

RS -> RS: build citations\n(z chunków z similarity)
RS --> CS: RagAnswer(text, citations, tokensUsed)
deactivate RS

CS -> CS: assistantMessage =\n  Message.assistantMessage(\n    tenant, sessionId, answer.text,\n    citations, tokensUsed, now)

CS -> CR: saveMessage(assistantMessage)
CR -> DB: INSERT messages\n(role=ASSISTANT, content,\n citations, tokens_used)

CS -> CR: saveSession(session.touchedAt(now))
CR -> DB: UPDATE chat_sessions\nSET last_activity_at=NOW()

CS --> Ctrl: Message (assistant, saved)
deactivate CS

Ctrl --> C: 200 OK\n{ id, role: "ASSISTANT",\n  content, sources, tokensUsed, createdAt }
deactivate Ctrl

note over C #LightBlue: Czas total: ~1.5-2s\n(embedding ~200ms,\n search ~50ms,\n LLM ~1-1.5s,\n save ~50ms)

@enduml
